   "description": "The hour-meter reading the worker entered at this event, cumulative over the life of the machine. THE SERIES IS THE RECORD: hours this season, hours since service and hours per checkout are all computed from these rows, and Asset Register.current_hours is only a cache of the highest one seen.",
